,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(1458,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> required.</p>\n<p>The number of moles of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.938ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3950.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1208,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1597,0)\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3125,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is given by its molarity times the volume in liters:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.238ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"48.239ex\" height=\"3.222ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 21321.8 1424.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g d